      {
        "id": 17292,
        "title": "O que são bibliotecas e CDN",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um jogo tem sistemas como saúde, pontuação e inimigos. Você também pode adicionar novos recursos como power-ups e níveis.</p><p>Existem bibliotecas em JavaScript também! Podemos pegar emprestado código escrito por outros e também contribuir com nosso código para que outros usem.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Outros programadores podem sentir que o código que escrevem pode ajudar outras pessoas. As bibliotecas JavaScript contêm código para uso público.</p><p>Para que seja útil, essas bibliotecas devem ser acessíveis.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>As bibliotecas geralmente são armazenadas em <code>Content Delivery Network (CDN)</code>. <code>CDN</code> é uma rede que entrega conteúdo da web rapidamente, servindo-o a partir de um servidor próximo.</p><p>Podemos usar uma biblioteca <code>CDN</code> incluindo-a no atributo <code>src</code> da tag <code>script</code> do nosso arquivo HTML.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game is loading...\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/gamekit.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O atributo <code>src</code> contém o <code>CDN</code> seguido por um <code>/</code> e o nome da biblioteca. Identifique o <code>CDN</code> e a biblioteca a partir do código abaixo.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> é o <code>CDN</code> e <code>spritefx.js</code> é a biblioteca</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> é a biblioteca e <code>spritefx.js</code> é o <code>CDN</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> é o <code>CDN</code> e <code>spritefx.js</code> é a biblioteca.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A biblioteca <code>spritefx.js</code> faz o sprite de um elemento com ID <code>\"player\"</code> balançar. Neste exemplo, <code>teach.getmimo.com</code> é o nosso <code>CDN</code>.</p><p>Adicione uma tag <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> e defina o valor correto para o atributo <code>src</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"#player\" class=\"selector-id\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>script</code> seguido de <code>src</code> e finalmente <code>\"https://mimo.org/spritefx.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como as bibliotecas nos ajudam a economizar tempo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Podemos usar uma solução que já foi escrita por outros programadores</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um designer de jogos vai corrigir nosso código para nós</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Podemos usar uma solução que já foi escrita por outros programadores.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que significa <code>CDN</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Central Data Notebook</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual <strong>library</strong> é importada no código abaixo?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>collisions.js</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>mimo.org</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>collisions.js</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importe a biblioteca <code>collisions.js</code>. O <code>CDN</code> que armazena a biblioteca é <code>https://teach.getmimo.com</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game uses libraries\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>https</code> seguido de <code>:</code> e depois <code>//mimo.org/</code>, <code>collisions.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17293,
        "title": "Bibliotecas JS",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com bibliotecas, podemos usar a solução que outra pessoa codificou para resolver um problema que estamos enfrentando.</p><p>Cada biblioteca é diferente. Quando usamos uma biblioteca, precisamos verificar a documentação para saber como usar as funções que ela fornece.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com base na documentação abaixo, qual função devemos usar para adicionar pontos à pontuação do jogador?</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   table,&#xA;   td {&#xA;    border: solid 1px black;&#xA;    border-collapse: collapse;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score Library&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Open-sourced library for basic score calculations in games.&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;table&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;addPoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to add points to the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;removePoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to remove points from the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;resetScore()&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to reset the score to 0&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;formatScore(score)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to format the score for the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Version 3.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Added input handling to accept String values as parameter&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>removePoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>addLives(lives)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para usar código de bibliotecas, precisamos encontrar a função na documentação e usá-la onde for necessário.</p><p>Mostre o resultado de adicionar <code>50</code> pontos a uma pontuação de <code>0</code> usando a função que encontramos na biblioteca <code>score.js</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>score</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>addPoints</code>, <code>(0, 50)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Existem muitas bibliotecas que podemos usar. Aqui, <code>state.js</code> nos permite formatar e exibir um estado de jogo usando JavaScript.</p><p>Qual parte do código você acha que a biblioteca <code>state.js</code> fornece?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateLabel = state(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameover&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").format(\" /><text value=\"&quot;TITLE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ui = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ui.innerHTML = stateLabel;\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Current Game State\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/state.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>format(\"TITLE\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>ui</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>format(\"TITLE\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Outro benefício das bibliotecas é que os problemas geralmente são rapidamente corrigidos por seus usuários. Tente adicionar pontos com um <code>String</code>.</p><p>Podemos pensar que não vai funcionar. No entanto, ainda está funcionando porque outra pessoa já pensou nesse caso!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"50\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
